%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Terminal
  participant P1 as CLI
  participant P2 as agent-plane
  participant P3 as Decisions
  participant P4 as PostgreSQL
  P0->>P1: register a
  P1->>P2: register R1, P
  P2->>P4: transaction: reserve R1
  P4->>P2: committed
  P2-xP1: registered
  P1->>P0: no reply
  P0->>P1: retry R1
  P1->>P2: register R1, P
  P2->>P4: look up R1
  P4->>P2: found, P matches
  P2->>P1: same record
  Note over P0,P4: agent-plane restarts: memory lost, records remain
  P0->>P1: inspect a
  P1->>P2: inspect a
  P2->>P4: read record
  P4->>P2: committed record
  P2->>P1: same record
  P0->>P1: reuse R1, P2
  P1->>P2: register R1, P2
  P2->>P3: event: R1, P2
  P3->>P2: reply: conflict
  P2->>P1: conflict
